From bd9fb6bd4f6f3935b31fdee4e8ffd815c6284a3c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: virt-ios <virt-ios@localhost>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 11:50:18 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] runtime: build on Windows

dirty_pages and texture/rotation hold no Unix calls but were gated
cfg(unix) while every platform uses them; dma_buf is the Unix-only one
and was ungated. foreign_acquirer (no dma-buf dependency) moves from
dma_buf.rs to device/mod.rs so the heap and in-place rebinds compile
where dma-buf imports do not exist; ImportHold::wait matches the empty
enum off Unix.

Verified: cargo check -p reims-vgpu-vulkan on x86_64-pc-windows-msvc
gets past metal2vulkan-runtime (0 errors there).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
